         "params": {
          "card_align": "left",
          "card_style": "plain",
          "cards": [
           {
            "content": "<p>Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>",
            "number_or_eyebrow": "01",
            "title": "BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>",
            "number_or_eyebrow": "02",
            "title": "DESIGN YOUR BRAND"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>",
            "number_or_eyebrow": "03",
            "title": "START SELLING FAST"
           }
          ],
          "eyebrow_style": "text",
