      "rowMetaData": [],
      "rows": [
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "PL - Card Grid",
         "name": "module_3",
         "params": {
          "accent_color": {
           "color": "#6BA644",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "card_align": "left",
          "card_style": "card",
          "cards": [
           {
            "content": "<p>Soft gels are the gold standard for fish oil, vitamin D, vitamin E, CoQ10, and other oil-based or oil-soluble ingredients. The format protects sensitive actives and delivers them in a single, easy-to-swallow dose.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Best format for oils and oil-soluble actives",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-e2f38469a7.svg"
            },
            "title": "Best format for oils and oil-soluble actives"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Soft gels are sealed shut after filling, preventing oxygen exposure that degrades sensitive ingredients. This is especially important for omega-3s and other oils that turn rancid in lesser packaging.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Sealed integrity, no oxidation",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-ae9b4a4f61.svg"
            },
            "title": "Sealed integrity, no oxidation"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Soft gel shells dissolve faster than tablets or hard capsules, releasing actives sooner in the digestive process. The right choice when bioavailability and onset speed matter.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Faster absorption than hard-shell formats",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-d03e635789.svg"
            },
            "title": "Faster absorption than hard-shell formats"
           }
          ],
          "eyebrow_style": "text",
          "gap": 28,
          "icon_badge": true,
          "icon_badge_color": {
           "color": "#c9dbe2",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "icon_tile": true,
