          "section_headline": "",
          "stats": [
           {
            "description": "<p>Standard round and oval soft gels are easiest to swallow. Custom shapes available for brand differentiation on higher-volume runs.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Shape Options",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-7389db2445.svg"
            },
            "stat_label": "Shape Options",
            "value": "Round, Oval, Oblong"
           },
           {
            "description": "<p>Standard bovine-derived gelatin is most common. Fish-derived gelatin available for kosher or pescatarian positioning. Plant-based softgel alternatives are in development but limited in active compatibility.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Gelatin Source",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-0e742f57f3.svg"
            },
            "stat_label": "Gelatin Source",
            "value": "Bovine or Fish"
           },
           {
            "description": "<p>Soft gels accommodate a wide fill range. Standard fish oil and vitamin D soft gels sit around 500-1000mg. Higher fills possible based on shell capacity.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Fill Capacity",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-04cb8f7fc7.svg"
            },
            "stat_label": "Fill Capacity",
            "value": "Up to 1500mg fill"
           },
           {
            "description": "<p>Low order minimums and no set-up fees. Soft gel runs typically have a slightly higher MOQ than tablets due to encapsulation tooling. Scoped during discovery.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "Minimums &amp; Set-Up",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-681f7474d8.svg"
            },
            "stat_label": "Minimums &amp; Set-Up",
            "value": "Low MOQ"
           }
          ],
