         "name": "module_6",
         "params": {
          "buttons": [],
          "content": "<p>Soft gel encapsulation runs on rotary die machines that form, fill, and seal the capsule in a single pass. Every batch goes through in-process fill weight verification, seam integrity testing, and finished-product testing for identity, purity, potency, and contaminants before release. Drying and tumbling happen on-site, so your private label soft gels ship customer-ready.</p>",
